+# paper Receipt
+## Files Changed
+- `paper/echoforge_ieee.tex`: replaced the default manuscript with the focused final narrative, generated metric macros, focused figures, and runtime-code appendix input.
+- `paper/build.sh`: added metric macro generation and switched the build to the focused figure generator before visual/PDF validation.
+- `paper/generate_metric_macros.py`: added evidence-backed LaTeX metric macro generation from `outputs/paper-evidence/tier1-final`.
